### Default URL
GET http://localhost:8080/

### Display Json table
GET http://localhost:8080/api/contacts

### Display a contact with its id
GET http://localhost:8080/api/contacts/6af07fbdd4509d952f202b87

### Add a new contact
POST http://localhost:8080/api/contacts
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Marie",
  "age": 24
}

###

### Update a contact
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/contacts/6af0856c381cf89ea83b9549
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "age": 25
}
###

### Delete a contact
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/contacts/6af07fbdd4509d952f202b87